      description : "1.219 RHEL-09-255085"
      info        : "RHEL 9 must not allow users to override SSH environment variables.

GROUP ID: V-257993
RULE ID: SV-257993r1045049

SSH environment options potentially allow users to bypass access restriction in some configurations."
      solution    : "Configure the RHEL 9 SSH daemon to not allow unattended or automatic logon to the system by editing the following line in the \"/etc/ssh/sshd_config\" or in a file in \"/etc/ssh/sshd_config.d\":

PermitUserEnvironment no

Restart the SSH daemon for the setting to take effect:

$ sudo systemctl restart sshd.service"
