    <custom_item>
      type        : FILE_CONTENT_CHECK
      description : "1.386 RHEL-09-653105"
      info        : "RHEL 9 must write audit records to disk.

GROUP ID: V-258170
RULE ID: SV-258170r991589

Audit data should be synchronously written to disk to ensure log integrity. This setting assures that all audit event data is written disk."
      solution    : "Configure the audit system to write log files to the disk.

